        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "title": "Wprowadzenie",
            "anchor": "intro",
            "text": "If you are tired of drinking directly out of streams and ponds like a wild horse then consider making a $(item)Drinking Vessel!$()$(br2)Every time you drink from a vessel you will consume $(thing)100mB$() of fluid and damage the vessel 1 durability (if applicable) or has a chance of breaking (if applicable, can be changed in TFC server config)."
        },
        {
            "type": "patchouli:text",
            "text": "Drinking from a container will also work for acquiring drink effects from $(item)Alcohol$() or other fluids, as well as $(l:cooking/food_and_water#nutrients)Nutrient$() values.$(br2)$(o)$(7)Some drinking containers can even be played as a musical instrument when empty.$()"
